"bb_tag\">Starting Guide</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Pivot around to influence the position of your weapon. Don't let it do all the work!<br></li><li>Your weapon is also your shield. Deflect enemy blades away from you, then go for the kill.<br></li><li>Only the blade part of your weapon counts as a hit.<br></li><li>Star pieces do not disappear, but you do leave them behind you. Make sure to grab them.<br></li><li>Treasure chests appear at the end of levels. They reward you based on your highest combo.<br><strong>(Treasure chest star pieces = Highest Combo \u00f7 2)</strong><br></li><li>Rocks lower your combo timer, but don't be afraid to hit them to get an advantage!<br></li><li>Cutting grass slightly refills your combo timer.</li></ul>",
